stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "pending_payment" as pending_payment
    state "confirmed" as confirmed
    state "payment_failed" as payment_failed
    state "expired" as expired
    state "cancelled" as cancelled
    state "refunded" as refunded

    [*] --> pending_payment: checkout or waitlist promotion [seat available] / reserve until TTL or class start
    pending_payment --> confirmed: verified VNPay success [current live hold and capacity] / invoice and notify
    pending_payment --> payment_failed: verified non-success IPN / clear reservation and promote queue
    pending_payment --> expired: Celery, status read, or checkout cleanup [hold due] / clear reservation and promote queue
    pending_payment --> cancelled: member or class cancellation [before start] / cancel pending payment
    confirmed --> cancelled: member or class cancellation [before start] / refund_status = required for paid seat
    payment_failed --> pending_payment: retry checkout or promotion [capacity available] / create new payment or hold
    expired --> pending_payment: retry checkout or promotion [capacity available] / create new payment or hold
    cancelled --> pending_payment: retry checkout or promotion [refund not required] / create new payment or hold
    refunded --> pending_payment: new checkout or promotion [capacity available] / refund_status = none
    payment_failed --> refunded: admin resolves [refund_status = required] / refund_status = resolved
    expired --> refunded: admin resolves [refund_status = required] / refund_status = resolved
    cancelled --> refunded: admin resolves [refund_status = required] / refund_status = resolved

    note bottom of payment_failed
        Failed and expired holds release capacity and promote the earliest eligible
        waiting member in the same class-locked transaction.
    end note
    note bottom of refunded
        refunded means staff recorded an internal resolution.
        It does not prove a VNPay provider reversal.
    end note
